      "review": {
        "ja": "出版社側の抄録・書誌と大学公開原著の初期正列・AR(1)に関する検索返却箇所を確認。全文監査や任意の連鎖の収束証明を主張しません。",
        "en": "Publisher-side abstract/metadata and returned original-paper excerpts on initial-positive sequences and AR(1), from a university-hosted copy, checked. No full-text audit or convergence certificate for arbitrary chains is claimed."
      },
